            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Domino Golf is a western domino game played on a larger set where players use standard matching placements while trying to optimize scoring outcomes over multiple hands, analogous to minimizing a golf score.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'The game is encountered as a modern scoring-focused domino format that uses the larger tile set to support longer and more varied hand outcomes.',
              },
